  "description": "Leritor was a mineral-rich Mid Rim planet of rolling plains and oceans. The native Sauvax engaged in aquaculture; Human colonists mined the minerals. Amid a brewing war between the colonists and the Sauvax, Profex Rynalla attempted to excavate a Sith artifact buried within the planet's mountainous Bleaks.",
